  "content": "<p><strong>Flower Patch</strong> 允許你在同一個方塊空間內放置多朵花，類似海蘿蔔和蠟燭的運作方式。只需對同一種花使用右鍵點擊，它就會轉化為一個可以容納最多 4 朵花的<strong>花叢</strong>。（<strong>你不能混合搭配不同種類的花）</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>你也可以對現有的花使用骨粉來創建花叢。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0KFppoR.png\" alt=\"Akliz Partner\" width=\"320\" height=\"152\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fakliz.net%252fmrbysco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">需要伺服器嗎？使用優惠碼 \"mrbysco\" 首月可享八折優惠</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如有任何問題，歡迎加入我的 Discord。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/maPeNBK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/611982123435556884/widget.png?style=banner2\" alt=\"Discord Link\" width=\"320\" height=\"76\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>&nbsp;<strong>想要支持我們？</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Mrbysco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a>&nbsp; -Mrbysco</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/shynieke\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a>&nbsp; -ShyNieke</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
